---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - Houston Remodeling Leads | OilerBilt"
  description="Read the OilerBilt privacy policy to learn what information our Houston remodeling website collects, how we use it and how to contact us with requests."
  breadcrumbLabel="Privacy Policy"
>
  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> / Privacy Policy
      </nav>
      <p class="eyebrow">Effective September 9, 2026</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>How OilerBilt handles information submitted through this website.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <article class="article wrap legal-copy">
    <h2>Scope</h2>
    <p>
      This policy applies to information collected through oilerbilt.com and
      communications that begin through this website. It does not govern a
      third party’s website or service.
    </p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p>
      When you request an estimate, you may provide your name, phone number,
      email address, requested service, project description and an optional
      project photo. If you contact us directly, we also receive the information
      you choose to include in that conversation.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our hosting and form-service providers may automatically process basic
      technical information such as an IP address, browser or device type,
      requested page, referral information and access time for security,
      delivery and operational logging.
    </p>

    <h2>How we use information</h2>
    <p>We use information to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>review and respond to estimate requests;</li>
      <li>communicate about a requested or active project;</li>
      <li>operate, secure and improve the website;</li>
      <li>prevent misuse and comply with applicable legal obligations.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How information is shared</h2>
    <p>
      We may share information with vendors that host the website, process form
      submissions or otherwise help us respond to your request. We may also
      disclose information when reasonably necessary to comply with law,
      protect rights or safety, investigate misuse, or complete a business
      transfer. OilerBilt does not currently sell personal information or use it
      for targeted advertising.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p>
      This site does not currently use advertising or behavioral analytics
      cookies. Hosting infrastructure may use essential technologies and server
      logs needed to deliver and protect the site. If our practices change, this
      policy will be updated.
    </p>

    <h2>Retention and security</h2>
    <p>
      We retain inquiry and project information only as reasonably needed to
      respond, provide requested services, maintain business records, resolve
      disputes and meet legal obligations. We use reasonable safeguards, but no
      internet transmission or storage system can be guaranteed completely
      secure.
    </p>

    <h2>Your privacy choices</h2>
    <p>
      You may ask to access, correct or delete personal information associated
      with your inquiry. You may also ask questions or appeal a decision about a
      privacy request. We may need to verify your identity before acting and may
      retain information when required or permitted by law.
    </p>

    <h2>Children and external links</h2>
    <p>
      This website is intended for adults seeking remodeling services and is not
      directed to children under 13. Links to third-party websites, including
      social media and review services, are governed by those parties’ policies.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may revise this policy as the website or our practices change. The
      effective date at the top identifies the latest published version.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact us</h2>
    <p>
      For a privacy request, email
      <a href="mailto:oilerbilt@gmail.com">oilerbilt@gmail.com</a> or call
      <a href="tel:+14692492563">(469) 249-2563</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
